      en: ["Administrative seat of Mayahi Department in Maradi Region", "Located in a highly utilized agricultural zone", "Center for groundnut and millet production", "Important regional market for agricultural goods", "Population estimated between 40,000 and 45,000", "Part of the historical Hausa settlement areas"],
