      en: ["Capital of the Tillabéri Region in western Niger", "Important site for irrigated rice farming on the Niger River", "Strategic hub near the border with Mali", "Center of Songhai culture and traditions", "Located on the National Road towards Gao (Mali)", "Population of approximately 30,000 (2012 census)"],
