      en: ["Hosts one of the largest weekly markets in West Africa on Sundays.", "Major meeting point for Zarma, Tuareg, and Fulani communities.", "Located roughly 100 km northeast of the capital, Niamey.", "Central hub for regional cattle and small livestock trade.", "Administratively situated within the Filingué Department.", "Renowned for its cultural diversity and vibrant trading atmosphere."],
